OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns as river pollution
OL,4,Aincident kills fish
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised after a river
OL,7,Fpopular with walkers was polluted,
OL,8,Fcausing fish to die.
OL,10,FThe Environment Agency said it was
OL,11,Finvestigating an incident on the River
OL,12,FStort in Bishop's Stortford,
OL,13,FHertfordshire, after pollution was seen
OL,14,Fbeing discharged from a pipe into the
OL,15,Fwater on Friday.
OL,17,FThames Water, which manages wastewater
OL,18,Fin the area, said the issue had since
OL,19,Fbeen fixed and teams had worked to
OL,20,Fincrease oxygen levels in the water.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
