OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns as river pollution
OL,4,Aincident kills fish
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Strudwick has lived on a
OL,7,Fhouseboat on this stretch of the river
OL,8,Ffor three years and said the water had
OL,9,F"looked like old washing-up water" that
OL,10,Fsmelled like "horrible stagnant old
OL,11,Fwater".
